@backend_app_HostAddress = http://localhost:5188

### Register
POST {{backend_app_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "demo",
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "password": "correct-horse-battery"
}

### Login
POST {{backend_app_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "password": "correct-horse-battery"
}

### List employees (requires Authorization: Bearer <accessToken> from login/register above)
GET {{backend_app_HostAddress}}/api/employees
Accept: application/json

###
